Body:
I just got Opus 4.7 via Vertex to work from the "global" region in OpenCode 1.14.48.

```sh
VERTEX_LOCATION=global
```

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "enabled_providers": [
    "google-vertex"
  ],
  "provider": {
    "google-vertex": {
      "whitelist": [
        "claude-opus-4-7@default"
      ]
    }
}
```

I think https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/28347 is the fix for the issue we are facing
